flowchart LR
 Q[Learner question] --> P{Credential request}
 P -- Yes --> R[Policy refusal]
 P -- No --> C[TF IDF or hosted embedding retrieval]
 A[Approved PDFs] --> B[Page chunks]
 B --> C
 C --> D{Top score at least 0.12}
 D -- No --> E[not found]
 D -- Yes --> F[Extractive answer or hosted LLM]
 F --> G[Answer plus candidate sources and excerpts]
 G --> H[Evaluation CSV and manifest]
